  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. <br>• Thinly slice leek. Roughly chop snacking tomatoes. Grate zucchini. Drain and reserve oil from marinated goat cheese and set aside. <br>• Heat a large ovenproof saucepan over high heat with a drizzle of the reserved goat cheese oil. <br>• Cook leek, stirring, until browned and softened, 4-5 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957abd9848b9dac0593d2/step-55fd4100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Reduce heat to medium-high, then add tomatoes and cook, stirring, until softened, 2-3 minutes. <br>• Add Mediterranean seasoning, zucchini and risotto rice to pan and cook, stirring until fragrant, 1 minute. <br>• Remove saucepan from heat, then stir in stock concentrate and the boiling water(see ingredients). </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957abd9848b9dac0593d2/step-0a8c5010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Cover with a lid or tightly with foil. <br>• Bake until the liquid has been absorbed and the rice is ‘al dente’, 24-28 minutes. </p> <p><br>TIP: ‘Al dente’ rice is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957abd9848b9dac0593d2/step-8bc02120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Uncover risotto, then stir through basil pesto until combined. Season to taste with salt and pepper. <br>• Divide Mediterranean pesto veggie risotto between bowls. <br>• Top with goat cheese and flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy! </p> <p><br>TIP: If the rice is dry, add a splash of water and stir through.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957abd9848b9dac0593d2/step-177ed130.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
